  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 13882413060096
    m_Localized: "\u0421hase"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5573356970983555077
  - m_Id: 22933444268032
    m_Localized: The reconnaissance team intercepted information that a column carrying
      unknown weaponry is en route to one of Alkuda's camps. Our task is to intercept
      the column and identify the transported armaments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23353533173760
    m_Localized: Search
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23931281772544
    m_Localized: Thanks to the information obtained from the last mission, we managed
      to track the whereabouts of the Alkuda leader. It's time to deal with him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29742473187328
    m_Localized: Rat hole
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29772571512832
    m_Localized: You can't hide forever. All the trails lead to one place. A remote
      camp among the mountains, the last refuge of the Alkuda leader. There's nowhere
      left to run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
